  "description": "Linear algebra for the Epsilon symbolic math library: immutable matrices and vectors of expressions, exact rationals or doubles. Exact symbolic determinant, characteristic polynomial, inverse and solve without division; exact rational elimination; LU decomposition for doubles with singularity detection to working precision. Vector geometry (norm, cross product, angle, projection, reflection, lerp), blocks, ranges, powers and approximate equality.",
